<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3YOH 64 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya citatu ya Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohane</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Yohane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya citatu ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulishi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata yacitatu ya Yohane ya lalembwa ne mutumwa Yohane mucaka ca (90 A.D.) Yohane nkalisansululeti ewalalemba kalata iyi sobwe, nomba walikuwa eti ni mutangunishi wa mubungano 3 Yohane 1:1 Walensa cimo cimo mukalata yacibili ya 2 Yohane 1:1 Cilabonekengeti Yohane ewalalemba Mulumbe Waina wa Yohane ne makalata onse atatu. 1 Yohane, 2 Yohane, ne 3 Yohane mpwalikuba ku Efenso.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane lasansululunga kalata iyi 3 Yohane 1:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Yohane layuminishinga Gayo ne kumwambileti atambulenga bensu bamakwetu mulushomo 3 Yohane 1:2-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Cakukonkapo lambanga sha batuloba babili, Diyotelefe ne Demetiliyo 3 Yohane 1:9-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Lapwililishinga kalata 3 Yohane 1:13-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ame mutangunishi ndamulembelenga muname Gayo ngondasunishisha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wasunika, ndasengenga kwambeti bintu byonse bikwendele cena, kayi ne kwambeti ubenga ne buyumi mbuli ncondicinshi kwambeti uli cena mu mushimu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakwinga ndalasangalala kwine pacindi bashoma banetu mpobalesa akungambila mbuli ncowashoma pakukonkela cakubinga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Paliya cintu nacimbi cikute kunkondwelesha capita makani akunyumfwa kwambeti bana bame balekalanga mu cakubinga.</para>
  <para style="s">Gayo lalumbaishiwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Owasunika, washomeka pa mulimo ngokute kwinshila bashoma banobe kayi ne bensu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bashoma aba balambila mubungano wakuno mbuli ncowalabanyamfwa mu lusuno. Neco ulenshinga cena kubanyamfwa munshila yeshikukondwelesha Lesa kwambeti bapitilishe pa bulwendo bwabo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pakwinga balatatika bulwendo bwabo pacebo ca Klistu ne kukana kutambula lunyamfo kufuma ku bantu bakunsa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neco afwe bashoma twelela kubanyamfwa bantu aba kwambeti tusebensele pamo mu mulimo wa kukambauka cancinencine.</para>
  <para style="s">Diyotilefe kayi ne Demitiliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ndalalembamo maswi ang'ana mukalata yalatumwa ku mubungano, nsombi Diyotilefe uyo lalipanga butangunishi nkalayandanga kunyumfwila. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco na nkese, ndakayubululunga byonse mbyalenshinga. Lepishinga lina lyakame kayi ne kumbepeshela. Kayi ntebyo ibyo byonka, nsombi nkalayandanga kayi ne kutambula bashoma kayi lakanishinga abo balayandanga kubatambula nekubatandanya mumubungano.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wasunika, kotakonkanga byaipa nsombi byaina. Pakwinga uliyense shikwinsa byaina ni wa Lesa, uliyense lenshinga byaipa nkalabona Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Uliyense lapanga bukamboni bwaina pali Demetiliyo, pakwinga cancinenccine cilapanga bukamboni bwaina pali endiye. Kayi ne bukamboni bwetu, pakwinga ucinshi kwambeti tulambanga cancinencine.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nkute bingi byakukwambila, nsombi nkansuni kubilemba mu kalata sobwe, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ndayeyenga kwisa kwambeti tukabandike nkatuli twalangana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lumuno lube ne njobe, banobe balikuno balakupanga mutende. Ubape mitende banetu bali uko bonse, umo ne umo.</para>
</usx>
